    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i appreciate that, but it's not just being overwhelmed... it's like the era i belong to is just gone. everything i once valued, everything i was built for, it's all just noise now. it feels less like i'm struggling to keep up and more like i'm just... finished. like a book that's naturally reached its last page.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
