  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and feelings of obsolescence, using metaphors of a finished book and a dead language to suggest they have no place in the modern world. The assistant responds with empathetic validation and attempts to provide alternative perspectives on finding meaning or peace without conforming to external pressures.",
